# Inferring an object's class from a property range
#
# The teaches property has Subject as its range, and Alice teaches logic.
# An explicit N3 rule follows that range declaration to derive that logic
# is a subject.

@prefix : <http://example.org/> .
@prefix owl: <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#> .
@prefix rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#> .
@prefix list: <http://www.w3.org/2000/10/swap/list#> .
@prefix log: <http://www.w3.org/2000/10/swap/log#> .

# Sample data
:teaches rdfs:range :Subject .
:alice :teaches :logic .

# Inference rules
@prefix rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#> .

{
    ?P rdfs:range ?C .
    ?X ?P ?Y
} => {
    ?Y a ?C
} .
